### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@testDate = 2026-10-04
@testMonth = 2026-10

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Super Admin Login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "superadmin@todo.local",
  "password": "SuperAdminPass123"
}

### 3. Super Admin Overview Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats

### 4. Super Admin Daily Usage (Last 30 days default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/usage/daily

### 5. Super Admin Users List (Paginated with task counts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=10

### 6. Toggle User Active Status (Replace with a user ID)
@userId = 650000000000000000000001
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/{{userId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}
